MDL408, G9: routines takes no value, so "routines=--" puts "--" alone in
GLib's argument vector, where it ends option parsing: every following key of
the group is silently ignored. Here no-data is dropped, so the data IS dumped
(compare mdl402-no-data-zero-skips-data, where no-data applies).
-- scenario --
tool: mydumper
versions: >= v0.19.1-1
args: --defaults-file /work/mydumper.cnf --host mysql --user e2e --password e2e-password --database app
lint: MDL408
expect config-loaded: true
expect exit: 0
expect routines-dumped: true
expect data-dumped: true
-- mydumper.cnf --
[mydumper]
routines=--
no-data=1
